build/
*.iml

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Firebase / Google services credentials — NEVER commit
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# These files identify the Firebase project and carry its API keys. They are
# supplied to CI from secrets and written at build time; a copy committed here
# would stay in the git history of a public repository for good.
#
# app/.gitignore already ignores both at the two paths the build actually uses.
# These are the repo-wide net: they catch a copy dropped anywhere else, which
# is the case the path-specific rules miss.
#
# The Firebase integration is itself temporary — it exists only to distribute
# test builds and is to be removed before submission, since the challenge
# requires the app to make no network calls. Until then these rules stand.
google-services.json
GoogleService-Info.plist
**/google-services.json
**/GoogleService-Info.plist

# Local Docker image stamps (see Makefile)
.make/

# FVM: local SDK symlink (.fvmrc IS versioned, this is not)
.fvm/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build artefacts — repo-wide safety net
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The per-platform .gitignore files under app/ are the primary rules. These
# repeat the important ones at the root so an artefact is still ignored when a
# build drops it somewhere unexpected — a failed Xcode build in particular
# scatters files outside the directory it was invoked from, and `git add .`
# then sweeps them in.

# Xcode
**/DerivedData/
**/xcuserdata/
*.xcresult
**/*.xcworkspace/xcuserdata/
**/*.xcodeproj/xcuserdata/

# CocoaPods (Podfile and Podfile.lock are committed; installed pods are not)
**/Pods/

# Flutter / Dart
**/.dart_tool/
**/ephemeral/
**/flutter_assets/
*.flx
*.dill
.flutter-versions

# Gradle / Android
**/.gradle/
**/captures/
*.apk
*.aab
*.ap_
*.dex

# Signing material — these must NEVER be committed. The keystore belongs
# outside this repository entirely; see docs/android-build.md.
*.jks
*.keystore
*.p12
*.p8
*.mobileprovision
*.cer
**/key.properties

# OS noise
**/.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
